<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Entitlements of cascade-elevate-helper, applied only to the helper by
  .github/scripts/assemble-rc-dist.sh. The helper probe found NEEDS_PROFILE:
  the data-protection Keychain wants keychain-access-groups or
  application-identifier, which on macOS need an embedded provisioning
  profile. Signing those without a profile makes the helper unlaunchable, so
  this dict stays empty until the profile exists (see
  docs/elevation-helper.md). It never carries get-task-allow,
  allow-dyld-environment-variables, disable-library-validation or debugger:
  Cascade's requirement on the helper refuses them.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
